# Westly Demo Hotel — Cloudflare Pages redirects
# See DEPLOYMENT.md for the decision record.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── SPA catch-all: works immediately, with zero domain knowledge ────────────
# Any deep link (e.g. a bookmarked /admin/pin URL, a shared
# /booking/confirmation?id=... link) falls through to index.html so the
# client-side router (wouter) can handle it instead of 404ing.
/*  /index.html  200

# ── TODO: replace example.com with the real production domain before
#    deploying to production. Subdomain routing on Cloudflare Pages requires
#    literal hostnames, not wildcards — see DEPLOYMENT.md.
#
#    Until this block is edited, it cannot match any real hostname, so the
#    site simply serves the same SPA at every hostname (a safe, non-broken
#    default) rather than routing subdomains.
#
# admin.example.com/*        /admin/:splat   200
# admin.example.com          /admin/login    301
# hotel.example.com          /admin/pin      301
